{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_17", "source_id": "67697519000000001300076f", "title": "刷A醇的第五年", "content_type": "normal", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_67697519000000001300076f", "topic_family": "抗老与紧致", "mechanism_key": "time_feedback", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1225, "evidence_unit_count": 34, "original_evidence_unit_count": 34, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 0, "transcript_available": false, "evidence_basis": "image_ocr_and_publish_text", "traceable_anchors": ["刷了五年A醇，它带给我的好处我就不多说了，反正现在出去经常会被夸，你皮肤好好会发光，你在皮肤上花了很多钱吧，你真的是油痘肌", "其实我用它之前已经感觉用A用到了瓶颈期了，但用了它还是感觉让我皮肤一整个大刷新", "连用了一段时间后，我的素颜甚至比身边一些经常do项目的朋友还要好", "RETINOL 0.25 1USn.z./29.6ml", "le Capsules Serum Regeneration Aeceleree", "但是自从用了它跟烟酰胺精华之后，我被啪啪打脸了，因为它俩的缩毛孔效果不要太好", "而且这支k老效果是我觉得这几只里面zui快速的，当晚用了第二天早上起床仔细观察脸会感觉变丰盈平整了一点"], "retained_quotes": ["但是自从用了它跟烟酰胺精华之后，我被啪啪打脸了，因为它俩的缩毛孔效果不要太好", "而且这支k老效果是我觉得这几只里面zui快速的，当晚用了第二天早上起床仔细观察脸会感觉变丰盈平整了一点"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_67697519000000001300076f/images/ocr.json", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_67697519000000001300076f/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_67697519000000001300076f/source.json", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_67697519000000001300076f/images", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "86036e42d45c628254d6ddc8ca394a106a3780bb51bdd9935e8484fb3360b042", "card_hash": "50b3d7d9bc5e97de28f5ed69272c237dfc624da0f6ae4d1bc86ab540b03bd62f", "callable": false, "status": "