{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_17", "source_id": "676501d40000000009017e2e", "title": "家庭版毛孔深层清洁后续护肤分享", "content_type": "normal", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_676501d40000000009017e2e", "topic_family": "毛孔与清洁", "mechanism_key": "list_decision", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1802, "evidence_unit_count": 49, "original_evidence_unit_count": 49, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 0, "transcript_available": false, "evidence_basis": "image_ocr_and_publish_text", "traceable_anchors": ["我11年油痘肌，毛孔粗大、草莓鼻、脸上很多痘和闭口", "2、紫水光精华 md家这个紫水光用出来的效果和我在外面几千块钱biu出来的水光没差别，特别是在清洁完后马上用它一只，相当于家庭版水光毛孔清洁，第二天皮肤亮、白、润、嫩，毫不夸张就是韩式水光肌的样子", "O-Live Gel NET30ml/1foz", "TRIPLEACTION REPAIR Skin Brightening&", "50ml/17fl.oz U", "油橄榄对于熄灭红肿痘的火气效果非常好，基本上用了油橄榄之后，我再没有出现过做完清洁第二天爆痘的情况了", "1、油橄榄精华 不管我后续用什么护肤品，第一步我会先用2滴油橄榄精华打底"], "retained_quotes": ["油橄榄对于熄灭红肿痘的火气效果非常好，基本上用了油橄榄之后，我再没有出现过做完清洁第二天爆痘的情况了", "1、油橄榄精华 不管我后续用什么护肤品，第一步我会先用2滴油橄榄精华打底"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_676501d40000000009017e2e/images/ocr.json", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_676501d40000000009017e2e/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_676501d40000000009017e2e/source.json", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_676501d40000000009017e2e/images", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "080bcf72924dd886b1bd9ab69b357c6c997a3312b0ddd3fa0d39a44f2502f0a0", "card_hash": "f7abfbb3c655a9dd7a1e4d8d42820d6b34dbcd7f150ab48704f2070005b58dae", "callable": false, "status": "